onsistency and state management\n - Real-time synchronization for multi-user scenarios"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_017Q85w9QMPay5Tdiqc5jYk1","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

